    {
      "id": "U8U-READ-1",
      "title": "Our New Coach",
      "text": "Our school basketball team is made up of twelve players. Last month, a new coach came to guide us. He is not very tall, but his height is not a problem. He has the ability to find every small mistake. On the first day, he checked our weight and gave us some advice about food. He suggested more fish, eggs, and fruit. Our practices consist of running, shooting, and passing, and every practice is a big challenge. At first, some players wanted to quit. Then we won three games in a row, and we realized the coach was right. His influence on the team is really big. Before every game, he says, \"Don't be afraid to take a risk.\" Now we are capable of beating the best team in our city. For us, every season is a new adventure."
    }
  ],
